      "hypotheses": "Formal free two-generator product with sum t_i=sum v_i=1 and t_i>=0; no v_i sign restriction. c,d,e are specified BCH coefficients, delta=sum t_i³, chi=e+c²/2-d. Reset calculation uses exact stochastic S_g,R with RS_g=I and P_g=S_gR.",
